---
// DualUse · "same components, different attributes" pitched as a literal diff.
// The hero of this section IS the markup. Three differentiator attributes are
// inline-highlighted so the eye lands on the entire change at once.
---

<section id="dual" class="dual">
  <div class="inner">
    <p class="eyebrow"><span class="num">02</span> Two products, one folder</p>
    <h2>Add three attributes. The deck becomes a carousel.</h2>
    <p class="lede">
      Same components. Same theming. Same ~42 KB initial load. This wasn't
      planned. It falls out of building the engine on Web Components and CSS
      custom properties, so you get it for free.
    </p>

    <div class="diff-wrap">
      <header class="diff-head">
        <span class="from">A slide deck</span>
        <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        <span class="to">A carousel</span>
      </header>
      <pre class="diff" aria-label="Three attributes turn a deck into a carousel">
<span class="line"><span class="tok-pun">&lt;</span><span class="tok-tag">deck-root</span><span class="diff-add"> <span class="tok-attr">autoplay</span>=<span class="tok-str">"4000"</span> <span class="tok-attr">loop</span> <span class="tok-attr">swipe</span></span> <span class="tok-attr">transition</span>=<span class="tok-str">"slide"</span><span class="tok-pun">&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line">  <span class="tok-pun">&lt;</span><span class="tok-tag">deck-cover</span><span class="tok-pun">&gt;</span>...<span class="tok-pun">&lt;/</span><span class="tok-tag">deck-cover</span><span class="tok-pun">&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line">  <span class="tok-pun">&lt;</span><span class="tok-tag">deck-feature</span><span class="tok-pun">&gt;</span>...<span class="tok-pun">&lt;/</span><span class="tok-tag">deck-feature</span><span class="tok-pun">&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line">  <span class="tok-pun">&lt;</span><span class="tok-tag">deck-feature</span><span class="tok-pun">&gt;</span>...<span class="tok-pun">&lt;/</span><span class="tok-tag">deck-feature</span><span class="tok-pun">&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="tok-pun">&lt;/</span><span class="tok-tag">deck-root</span><span class="tok-pun">&gt;</span></span>
      </pre>
      <p class="diff-caption">
        <strong>Three attributes.</strong> That's the whole change. Same markup as
        any other deck. The engine stops waiting on you and starts
        auto-advancing, with touch swipe.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="cases">
      <article class="case">
        <header>
          <h3>As a slide deck</h3>
          <p class="case-line">Leave the three off. Keep 2D nav, the presenter window, speaker notes, step-reveal.</p>
        </header>
        <ul class="tags">
          <li><kbd>P</kbd> presenter</li>
          <li><kbd>O</kbd> overview</li>
          <li><kbd>.</kbd> blank</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="case">
        <header>
          <h3>As a carousel</h3>
          <p class="case-line">Add the three. Get touch swipe, autoplay that pauses on hover, an end that wraps to the start.</p>
        </header>
        <ul class="tags">
          <li>60 px swipe</li>
          <li>Hover-pause</li>
          <li>Loop</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style is:global>
  .dual {
    background: var(--rik-surface-raised);
    padding: var(--rik-space-7) var(--rik-space-5);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rik-border-default);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rik-border-default);
  }
  .inner { max-width: 1080px; margin: 0 auto; }

  .eyebrow {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
    color: var(--rik-accent--strong);
    font: 700 var(--rik-font-size-xs)/1 var(--rik-font-mono);
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin: 0 0 var(--rik-space-3);
  }
  .eyebrow .num {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 26px;
    height: 26px;
    background: var(--rik-accent__on);
    color: var(--rik-accent--strong);
    border: 2px solid var(--rik-accent);
    border-radius: 50%;
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }
  h2 {
    font-family: var(--rik-font-display);
    font-size: var(--rik-font-size-mega);
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--rik-text-default);
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    line-height: 1.05;
    margin: 0 0 var(--rik-space-3);
    max-width: 24ch;
  }
  .lede {
    font-size: var(--rik-font-size-lead);
    color: var(--rik-text-default--muted);
    line-height: 1.55;
    max-width: 72ch;
    margin: 0 0 var(--rik-space-6);
  }
  .lede code, .case code {
    font-family: var(--rik-font-mono);
    font-size: 0.92em;
    background: rgba(42, 37, 32, 0.06);
    color: var(--rik-text-default);
    padding: 2px 7px;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  /* ── The diff · hero of the section ────────────────────── */
  .diff-wrap {
    background: var(--rik-code__bg);
    border-radius: var(--rik-radius-md);
    padding: 0 0 var(--rik-space-3);
    box-shadow: var(--rik-elevation-3);
    margin-bottom: var(--rik-space-5);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .diff-head {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--rik-space-3);
    padding: var(--rik-space-3) var(--rik-space-4);
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--rik-status-success), var(--rik-accent));
    color: var(--rik-accent__on);
    font: 800 var(--rik-font-size-sm)/1 var(--rik-font-display);
    letter-spacing: -0.005em;
  }
  .diff-head .from, .diff-head .to {
    padding: 3px 8px;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.22);
    border-radius: 4px;
    color: #fff;
    text-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
  }
  .diff-head .arrow {
    font: 700 1.1rem/1 var(--rik-font-mono);
    opacity: 0.8;
  }
  .diff {
    margin: 0;
    padding: var(--rik-space-4);
    font-family: var(--rik-font-mono);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--rik-code__text);
    overflow-x: auto;
    white-space: pre;
  }
  .diff .line { display: inline; }
  .diff .tok-tag  { color: var(--rik-code__syntax-keyword); }
  .diff .tok-attr { color: var(--rik-code__syntax-property); }
  .diff .tok-str  { color: var(--rik-code__syntax-string); }
  .diff .tok-pun  { color: var(--rik-code__text); opacity: 0.65; }
  .diff .diff-add {
    background: rgba(0, 200, 160, 0.20);
    color: var(--rik-code__text);
    padding: 2px 6px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(0, 200, 160, 0.45);
  }
  .diff .diff-add .tok-attr { color: #c3e88d; font-weight: 700; }
  .diff-caption {
    margin: 0 var(--rik-space-4);
    padding-top: var(--rik-space-3);
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    font-size: var(--rik-font-size-sm);
    color: rgba(232, 228, 240, 0.72);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .diff-caption strong { color: var(--rik-status-success); font-weight: 800; }

  /* ── Two minimal cases · short headers, tag list ── */
  .cases {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--rik-space-4) var(--rik-space-6);
  }
  @media (max-width: 720px) { .cases { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .dual { padding: var(--rik-space-6) var(--rik-space-3); }
    .diff-head { gap: var(--rik-space-2); }
    .diff { font-size: 0.82rem; }
    .diff-caption { font-size: var(--rik-font-size-xs); }
  }
  .case header { margin-bottom: var(--rik-space-2); }
  .case h3 {
    font-family: var(--rik-font-display);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--rik-text-default);
    letter-spacing: -0.012em;
    line-height: 1.25;
    margin: 0 0 4px;
  }
  .case-line {
    font-size: var(--rik-font-size-body);
    color: var(--rik-text-default--muted);
    line-height: 1.55;
    margin: 0;
  }
  ul.tags {
    list-style: none;
    padding: var(--rik-space-3) 0 0;
    margin: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rik-border-default);
    display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 6px 10px;
    font-size: var(--rik-font-size-sm);
    color: var(--rik-text-default--faint);
  }
  ul.tags li { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }
  kbd {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 1px 6px;
    background: var(--rik-surface-raised);
    border: 1px solid var(--rik-border-default);
    border-bottom-width: 2px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font: 700 0.78em/1.2 var(--rik-font-mono);
    color: var(--rik-text-default);
  }
</style>
